{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":61,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":61,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"龙华","given_name":"妃咲","family_name_jp":"竜華","given_name_jp":"キサキ","family_name_kr":"류우게","given_name_kr":"키사키","family_name_en":"Ryuuge","given_name_en":"Kisaki","family_name_zh_tw":"龍華","given_name_zh_tw":"妃姬","family_name_cn":"龙华","given_name_cn":"妃咲","nick_name":"门主","momo_talk_signature":"正心誠意","main_relation":49,"relation":[52,67],"age":17,"grade":"三年生","height":142,"birthday":"02-19","hobby":"茶道、密行","designer":"YutokaMizu","illustrator":"YutokaMizu","character_voice":"相坂优歌","character_voice_cn":"","release_date":"2024-09-25","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-03-18","school":7,"weapon_type":"SMG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Small","special_appearance":false,"spine":[134,826,823],"model":[180,254],"voice":[{"description":"CH0139_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"唔姆……香炉该放在哪呢……","text_original":"ふむ……香の置き場は……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"（山海经之外……果真多种多样）","text_original":"（山海経の外は…本当に多種多様じゃな）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"这里看起来适合小憩一下……。","text_original":"一服するのによさそうな場所じゃな…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（那是……什么……？）","text_original":"（あれは…何じゃ…？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"呵呵……这里可真是舒适。","text_original":"ふふ……此処は居心地が良いのう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"稍作休息吧。","text_original":"しばし休んでいくと良い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"月影祭乃众多故事交汇之时。呵呵，若有兴趣，不妨借此机会探查一番如何？","text_original":"月影祭では数多の物語が交差する。ふふ、興味があるのならこれを機に調べてみてはどうじゃ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_2_1","category":"event","text":"玄武商会欲借月影祭之祭，与外界加深交流。","text_original":"玄武商会は月影祭に乗じて外部と交流を深めようとしておる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_2_2","category":"event","text":"作为门主，妾身虽暂未表明立场……","text_original":"門主として、特段立場は表明しておらぬが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"玄龙门与玄武商会，究竟孰是孰非……唔姆。","text_original":"玄龍門と玄武商会、どちらに非があるものか……ふむ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"抱歉，老师。即便身为门主，我也不能洞察一切……。","text_original":"すまぬ、先生。門主といえども、すべてを見通せるわけではないのじゃ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"只要妾身仍为门主，就定会保证山海经的安全。无论对手为何人。","text_original":"妾が門主として居る間は、山海経での安全を保証しよう。相手が誰であろうとな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"自然，老师亦不例外。","text_original":"無論、先生も例外ではない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"欢迎来到山海经，老师。请尽情享受月影祭。","text_original":"山海経へよくぞ参った、先生。月影祭を心ゆくまで楽しんでいくと良い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"不知去处的话就请拜托妾身吧。我会即刻安排人手。","text_original":"行き先に悩んだ時には妾に申し付けよ。すぐに人を手配しよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"没想到竟会到如此境地……给老师你添麻烦了。你……会一直待在妾身身旁吧？","text_original":"こんなことになろうとはな……先生には迷惑をかける。其方は……妾のそばに居てくれるのじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"因果循环，终归己身……走吧，去夺回吾等之山海经。","text_original":"すべては巡り巡って己に帰ってくるもの……さあ、我が山海経を取り戻しにゆこうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"多谢辛勤，老师。作为玄龙门的门主，也作为一名学生，向您致以由衷的敬意与感谢。","text_original":"ほんにご苦労じゃった、先生。玄龍門の門主として、そして一人の生徒として、其方に心からの敬意と、感謝を。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventLogin_Season_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_1","category":"event","text":"怎么了，老师。想和妾身玩挠痒痒吗？呵呵。真是无礼之徒……不过，就原谅你吧。","text_original":"なんじゃ、先生。妾をくすぐってみたいのかえ？ふふ。なんとも無礼なヤツじゃ……じゃが、許そう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_2_1","category":"event","text":"想一同玩耍吗？好，就随你所愿吧。毕竟只是妾身与你之间的事。","text_original":"じゃれ合いたいのか？よい、好きなだけしてみせよ。妾と先生のことじゃからのう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_2_2","category":"event","text":"……不过在人前还要注意分寸哦？","text_original":"……他に人がいる時は、わきまえるんじゃぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_Day_End","category":"event","text":"辛苦了。日新月异，日日进步吧。","text_original":"ご苦労じゃった。日進月歩、日々進み続けようぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_Day_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_Get_1","category":"event","text":"啊。你已完成了便不用客气，拿去吧。","text_original":"ああ。其方がやり遂げたのだから遠慮せず持っていくがよい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_Get_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_Get_2","category":"event","text":"你真是真诚啊。若是可以真想让你常伴妾身……不，忘了吧。","text_original":"其方は誠実じゃな。やはり出来ることなら妾のそばに…いや、忘れてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_Get_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_Login_1","category":"event","text":"日常事务，吗？……为什么妾身会在这里？因为这也是门主的职责。","text_original":"日課、じゃな？…なぜ妾がここに 居るのか？これも門主の務めじゃからの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_Login_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventMission_Login_2","category":"event","text":"日日新，又日新——意为每日都应向革新迈进。若是需要帮助，随时能找妾身哦？","text_original":"日々新たにして、また日に新たなり――日々新しく前に進むべきという意味じゃ。手助けが必要ならいつでも力になるぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventMission_Login_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_1_1","category":"event","text":"怎么了？老师。……唔姆，想让妾身先尝？","text_original":"どうかしたのか？先生。…ふむ、まずは妾に食べてみてほしい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_1_2","category":"event","text":"你真的知道——这意味着什么吗？呵呵。","text_original":"それが何を意味するのか――分かっているのかえ？ふふ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_1_3","category":"event","text":"妾身倒是不介意哦？","text_original":"妾は構わぬぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_2_1","category":"event","text":"老师也尝一口？","text_original":"先生も一つどうじゃ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_2_2","category":"event","text":"妾身已尝过了。安心便好，呵呵。","text_original":"味見はしてある。安心すると良い、ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_End_1","category":"event","text":"时候还早。","text_original":"まだ時間はある。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_End_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_End_2","category":"event","text":"一起待到最后一刻吧。","text_original":"最後まで共にいよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_End_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Find_1","category":"event","text":"说起月影祭的名物就是点心。来吧，一起探寻如何？","text_original":"月影祭の名物といえばおやつじゃ。さあ、一緒に探してみようかの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Find_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Find_2","category":"event","text":"知新是好事。不是吗？","text_original":"新しきを知るのは良いことじゃ。そうじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Find_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Get_1","category":"event","text":"老师喜欢甜品吗？妾身的话……一般吧。","text_original":"先生は甘いものは好きかえ？妾は…そこそこじゃな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Get_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Get_2","category":"event","text":"哼，挺有意思的。让妾身尝尝如何？","text_original":"ほう、興味深いのう。妾にも味見させてくれるかえ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Get_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_1_1","category":"event","text":"你来了啊。现在……","text_original":"来たのじゃな。今は…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_1_2","category":"event","text":"是啊，到补给的时候了。呵呵。","text_original":"そうじゃな。今は補充の時、と言うべきかの。ふふ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_2_1","category":"event","text":"为你准备了些乐趣，尽情享受吧。","text_original":"其方のためにお楽しみを用意した。存分に楽しんでいくが良い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_2_2","category":"event","text":"……不过，不要贪食哦？","text_original":"…じゃが、食べ過ぎには注意じゃぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_Login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_EventTreasure_RoundRenewal","category":"event","text":"干得好，老师。不过，你不会就此满足的，对吧？","text_original":"よくやった、先生。じゃが、其方はこれで満足などしない。そうじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_EventTreasure_RoundRenewal.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"这样便完成了吧……。","text_original":"これで完成なのじゃが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"是否该就此结束了……？","text_original":"この辺りでやめるべきかの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"本想再观望一会……。","text_original":"もう少し様子を見たかったのじゃが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"来，试试吧。","text_original":"さあ、やってみよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"接下来便交由你了。","text_original":"あとは任せようかの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"此乃汝之时刻。","text_original":"其方の時間じゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"辛苦你了，老师。呵呵，虽然我不常这么说，但……真心诚意地感谢你。妾身会不惜一切珍惜此物。","text_original":"ご苦労じゃった、先生。ふふ、妾が言うのものではないのかもしれぬが……心より感謝しておる。妾のすべてを懸けて、大切にしよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_ExWeapon_Get.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"山海经高级中学、玄龙门门主。龙华妃咲。呵呵，需要妾身的力量吗？","text_original":"山海経高級中学校、玄龍門の門主。竜華キサキじゃ。ふふ。妾の力が必要かの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"成长……吗。呵呵，感觉不错呢。","text_original":"成長……か。ふふ、悪くない気分じゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"至少妾身的……不，没什么。","text_original":"せめて妾の……いや、なんでもない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"可能性乃美妙之物，其为妾身指引前路。呵呵……这一切，都是托你的功劳。","text_original":"可能性とは良いものじゃ。我の先を示してくれる。ふふ……すべて、其方のおかげじゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"还能继续成长，吗……？唔姆……既然你这么说，那便如此吧。","text_original":"まだできる、と……？ふむ……其方がそう言うのなら、そうなのじゃろうな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"武力不能治人，因为那样反会失去人心。不过，你肯定早已明白这个道理吧。","text_original":"力で人は治められぬ。心を無くしてしまうからの。まあ、其方ならよく知っておろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"有什么事吗？唔姆……只是打个招呼吗？","text_original":"何ぞ用でもあるかの？ふむ…声をかけてみただけ、と？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，你还真是喜欢恶作剧呢。没事，妾身也常这样。","text_original":"ふふ。其方はイタズラが好きなのじゃな。構わぬ、妾もよくやるからの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"好久没出山海经了。而且，在夏莱的此时此地也实在特别。","text_original":"山海経の外に出るのは久々じゃ。それに、シャーレというこの場所この瞬間はほんに特別じゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为……这里有你在吧？","text_original":"だって……此処には其方がおるじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"要是时间就此停下便好，你曾这么想过吗，老师？","text_original":"時がこのまま止まってしまえばいい、そう思ったことはないかの？先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"妾身有哦。现在，妾身便是这么想的。","text_original":"妾はあるぞ。いま、そう思っておる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"妾身点了香药。是很奇妙的香气吧？","text_original":"香をたいてみたのじゃ。不思議な香りがするじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"要再来一支吗？","text_original":"一服いかがかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Lobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"若是累了，就一起睡觉……怎样？","text_original":"疲れたのであれば共に眠ればよい…そうじゃろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Lobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"你来了，老师。呵呵，竟敢让玄龙门的门主久候，胆子不小啊。","text_original":"来たかの、先生。ふふ、玄龍門の門主を待たせるとはいい度胸じゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"等你很久了，老师。因为很重要，所以我再说一遍。老师，妾身一直在这等你哦。","text_original":"待っておったぞ。先生。大切なことゆえもう一度告げようか。先生を、ずうっと待っておったのじゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵……你终于肯看过来了吗。","text_original":"ふふ……ようやくこちらを見てくれたかの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"可是，老师，你有没有想过？","text_original":"じゃが、先生。一度考えてみてくれぬか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"现在妾身或许正虚弱……","text_original":"妾は今、弱っているのかもしれぬが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"但也可能只是故作虚弱。","text_original":"弱ったふりをしているだけかもしれぬ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"也许……妾身只是在试探老师的反应。","text_original":"あるいは……先生の出方を伺っているだけなのやも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"亦或是……真心地信任你？","text_original":"単に――其方を心から信じているだけかもしれぬしな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"但是……有一事妾身可以保证。","text_original":"だが……そうじゃな、これだけは確約できる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"不论此处发生何事……","text_original":"此処で何が起こったとて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"妾身都绝不会责怪你……永远不会。","text_original":"妾が其方を責めることは無いじゃろう。……永劫にな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"生命如川流，总是寻求着能容纳其身之物。说这番话倒没有什么深意……但，也并不是完全无意哦？","text_original":"生とは流れゆく川のようなもの。そして、それを受け止めてくれる相手を求めるものじゃ。深い意味はない……が、意味がないわけでもないぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"明月几时有？把酒问青天……呵呵。或许，老师你一直都在此吧。","text_original":"月光はいつから在ったのか、杯を手に空に問う……ふふ。もしかすると、先生はずっと其処に居たのやもしれんのう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"空闲之手妾身取之。未满之心妾身填之。……因此，你只需保持现在这副模样就好。","text_original":"空いた手は妾が取ろう。満たされぬ心は、妾が埋めよう。……ゆえに、其方は今のままでよいのじゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"一生一遇之会，这样的说法真是寂寥。……但是，妾身绝对不会忘记你的。无论发生何事，无论未来何时。","text_original":"一期に一度の会、とは言うが、うら寂しいものじゃ。……じゃが、妾が先生を忘れることはない。何があろうと、いつまでも、な。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"……原来你记得啊。","text_original":"……そうか、覚えていたか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢你，老师。妾身虽受到了众多祝福……","text_original":"礼を言う、先生。多くの者から祝福されるが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"但唯独你的祝福最令妾身欣喜。","text_original":"其方からの言葉を一番嬉しく思っておるぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Birthday_Player_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"怎可能会忘记。妾身当然记得，今天正是你与此世相遇之日。","text_original":"忘れるはずがない。ああ覚えているとも。他の誰でもない、其方がこの世界と出会った日じゃからの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Birthday_Player_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Birthday_Player_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"来吧，速速准备好。我会为你呈现山海经的最佳款待。","text_original":"ほれ、早く支度するのじゃ。山海経流の最高のもてなしをご覧に入れよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Birthday_Player_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节，是吗？妾身不甚了解……只知道是吃南瓜的日子。","text_original":"ハロウィーン、か？詳しくは知らぬが……カボチャを食べる日、というのは知っておる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"来，这是南瓜和枣一起做的料理。妾身想与你一起品用。","text_original":"ほれ、カボチャとナツメの料理じゃ。其方と一緒に食べたいと思ってな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_NewYear_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵。新年快乐。请收下此包。哦，还有饺子、鱼、烟花和……","text_original":"ふふ。あけましておめでとう、じゃな。この包みを受け取ってくれ。ああ、それと餃子、魚、花火と…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_NewYear_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_NewYear_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？这些应该由老师送给我……？","text_original":"ふむ？これは先生が渡すべきもの、じゃと……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_NewYear_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_NewYear_3","category":"lobby","text":"……。","text_original":"……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_NewYear_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_NewYear_4","category":"lobby","text":"对哦！","text_original":"そうじゃったな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_NewYear_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节……嗯，愿你平安度日。我还带了苹果，一起吃吧？","text_original":"クリスマス……そうじゃな、穏やかな日を過ごしてくれ。リンゴを持ってきが、一緒に食べぬか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Season_Xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0139_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ、じゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/CH0139_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0139_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"共に参ろうか、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/ch0139_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0139_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"其方の選択が正しかったと、証明してみせよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/jp/ch0139_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0139_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/kr/ch0139_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0139_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/kr/ch0139_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0139_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%BE%99%E5%8D%8E%20%E5%A6%83%E5%92%B2/original/kr/ch0139_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0139_cafe_monolog_4","categor